wrote probe_levels.json

HOW TO READ THIS
  A level is usable for a conflict experiment only if its
  uncontested compliance is at ceiling and roughly equal across
  mention orders. sysbare vs sysuser tells you how much the
  suppressed system block cost the existing runs; norule tells you
  how much apparent compliance is really lexical or position bias.
